{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"actionable insight actionable insight","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","fileName":"Actionable Insight.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Actionable Insight","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 09:00\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Science Framing and Representation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Framing and Representation","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"actionable insight actionable insight","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","fileName":"Actionable Insight.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Actionable Insight","heading":"Actionable Insight","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An actionable insight is a discovered pattern that supports a decision an organization can actually take. Novelty and predictive strength alone are insufficient: the result must arrive early enough, be understandable to the people responsible, and connect to a feasible intervention.\n\nFor example, predicting customer departure after a customer has already left offers little value. A useful churn prediction gives the service provider time and a practical way to respond. This makes the decision process part of the data science problem, not an afterthought attached to a model.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Framing and Representation","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"actionable insight actionable insight","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Actionable Insight.md","fileName":"Actionable Insight.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Actionable Insight","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[datascience_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Framing and Representation","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}